(7127518, 1090867, 16106, '<td valign="top">If you had been a bit more geometric with the placement, this would have done better. I had the same issue. When shooting it looks fine, when running through lots of shots, the exactness of placement can be make or break.</td>', 'If you had been a bit more geometric with the placement, this would have done better. I had the same issue. When shooting it looks fine, when running through lots of shots, the exactness of placement can be make or break.', '2013-11-08 18:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7127520, 1090018, 16106, '<td valign="top">Having the blur lines look like the candy is being abducted by aliens is distracting. Second curtain flash; learn it, use it, love it. Otherwise solid concept, good balance of white and color, well shot.</td>', 'Having the blur lines look like the candy is being abducted by aliens is distracting. Second curtain flash; learn it, use it, love it. Otherwise solid concept, good balance of white and color, well shot.', '2013-11-08 18:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
