(7130271, 1090476, 19825, '<td valign="top">What?!? This was in my top two. Sorry I did not comment earlier, and surprised this did not finish higher. First of all, I love the portrait pose and lighting. And, I thought the lollipop added a nice playful feel to it. It''s a winner with me.</td>', 'What?!? This was in my top two. Sorry I did not comment earlier, and surprised this did not finish higher. First of all, I love the portrait pose and lighting. And, I thought the lollipop added a nice playful feel to it. It''s a winner with me.', '2013-11-15 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
