(7130274, 1090863, 30861, '<td valign="top">looking a little demented, Derek. I''m not sure I''d trust you to guide me over the Rockies in a blizzard... :-)</td>', 'looking a little demented, Derek. I''m not sure I''d trust you to guide me over the Rockies in a blizzard... :-)', '2013-11-15 10:17:38.000000', NULL, 0),
