(7150779, 1090881, 60173, '<td valign="top">Mmm, jelly beans! I''m with you, I probably shouldn''t eat them either, heh. <br/> <br/>These jelly beans pop right off the screen. Your colors are bright and rich. I like your composition and that a few have spilled out of their dish. You know you have to eat those, right??<br/> <br/>I think where this image lacks is the lighting. It is pretty harsh and could use a lot of softening/diffusing by either passing the light through a white screen of some sort or bouncing it off of something else.</td>', 'Mmm, jelly beans! I''m with you, I probably shouldn''t eat them either, heh.  These jelly beans pop right off the screen. Your colors are bright and rich. I like your composition and that a few have spilled out of their dish. You know you have to eat those, right?? I think where this image lacks is the lighting. It is pretty harsh and could use a lot of softening/diffusing by either passing the light through a white screen of some sort or bouncing it off of something else.', '2014-01-02 13:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
