(7532103, 1090786, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Gross. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lol.  It was really good. :)<br/> <br/>Japan has had a ton of limited edition Kit Kats in the last 15+ yrs, like Cheesecake (blueberry, strawberry, or lemon) Pumpkin, Creme brulee, Salted caramel, and even things like Soy sauce and Wasabi.  Close to 300 different ones in all.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Gross.   Lol.  It was really good. :) Japan has had a ton of limited edition Kit Kats in the last 15+ yrs, like Cheesecake (blueberry, strawberry, or lemon) Pumpkin, Creme brulee, Salted caramel, and even things like Soy sauce and Wasabi.  Close to 300 different ones in all.', '2017-08-31 04:50:21.000000', NULL, 0);
